#. const HINT_SPOTLIGHT := "Ash Hurlers crack the ice: shell the floe under them."
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:88
msgid "Ash Hurlers crack the ice: shell the floe under them."
msgstr "Les Ash Hurlers fendent la glace : bombardez la banquise sous leurs pieds."

#. [&"narrator", "Glasswater Mere has not thawed in a hundred winters. Something at the bottom still shines."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:144 data/voice/lines/m02.json:L1
msgid "Glasswater Mere has not thawed in a hundred winters. Something at the bottom still shines."
msgstr "Le Glasswater Mere n'a pas dégelé depuis cent hivers. Au fond, quelque chose brille encore."

#. [&"vessa", "Malrik's diggers on Torvald's lake. Torvald must be thrilled."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:145 data/voice/lines/m02.json:L2
msgid "Malrik's diggers on Torvald's lake. Torvald must be thrilled."
msgstr "Les fouilleurs de Malrik sur le lac de Torvald. Torvald doit être ravi."

#. [&"torvald", "Two children, fighting on my lake. Finish it quickly, and leave my ice alone."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:146 data/voice/lines/m02.json:L3
msgid "Two children, fighting on my lake. Finish it quickly, and leave my ice alone."
msgstr "Deux enfants qui se battent sur mon lac. Finissez vite, et laissez ma glace tranquille."

#. [&"pell", "You again! My wheels froze to the road, so I suppose I'm open. Take this, it's on the house. The ho
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:147 data/voice/lines/m02.json:L4a
msgid "You again! My wheels froze to the road, so I suppose I'm open. Take this, it's on the house. The house is frozen too."
msgstr "Encore vous ! Mes roues ont gelé sur la route, donc je suis ouvert. Tenez, c'est la maison qui offre. La maison est gelée aussi."

#. [&"vessa", "Pell's cart, and no Pell. Maybe I should have opened that cage. Well. Finders keepers."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:148 data/voice/lines/m02.json:L4b
msgid "Pell's cart, and no Pell. Maybe I should have opened that cage. Well. Finders keepers."
msgstr "La charrette de Pell, sans Pell. J'aurais dû ouvrir cette cage. Bah. Qui trouve garde."

#. [&"vessa", "Emberguard, on your feet! Stamp a bit. Your toes will come back. Probably."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:149 data/voice/lines/m02.json:L5
msgid "Emberguard, on your feet! Stamp a bit. Your toes will come back. Probably."
msgstr "Emberguard, debout ! Tapez du pied. Vos orteils vont revenir. Sûrement."

#. [&"malrik", "More diggers, more knives. You should have burned my hall when you had the chance."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:150 data/voice/lines/m02.json:L6a
msgid "More diggers, more knives. You should have burned my hall when you had the chance."
msgstr "Plus de fouilleurs, plus de couteaux. Fallait brûler ma salle quand tu pouvais."

#. [&"malrik", "Someone burned my barracks, so I brought fewer friends. Very petty. I respect it."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:151 data/voice/lines/m02.json:L6b
msgid "Someone burned my barracks, so I brought fewer friends. Very petty. I respect it."
msgstr "On a brûlé ma caserne, alors j'ai moins d'amis. Bien mesquin. Je respecte."

#. [&"vessa", "Thin ice! Ha! I am absolutely doing that again."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:152 data/voice/lines/m02.json:L7
msgid "Thin ice! Ha! I am absolutely doing that again."
msgstr "Glace mince ! Ha ! Je refais ça, c'est certain."

#. [&"torvald", "That ice has kept a secret for a hundred winters, ember. Think before you melt it."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:153 data/voice/lines/m02.json:L8
msgid "That ice has kept a secret for a hundred winters, ember. Think before you melt it."
msgstr "Cette glace garde un secret depuis cent hivers, braise. Réfléchis avant de la fondre."

#. [&"vessa", "A hundred winters of ice, and it took me one afternoon. Somebody write that down."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:154 data/voice/lines/m02.json:L9
msgid "A hundred winters of ice, and it took me one afternoon. Somebody write that down."
msgstr "Cent hivers de glace, et il m'a fallu un après-midi. Que quelqu'un le note."

#. [&"torvald", "So be it. My lake will see you out. Slowly."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:155 data/voice/lines/m02.json:L10
msgid "So be it. My lake will see you out. Slowly."
msgstr "Soit. Mon lac vous raccompagnera. Lentement."

#. [&"whisper", "Two. You're doing so well."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:156 data/voice/lines/m02.json:L15
msgid "Two. You're doing so well."
msgstr "Deux. Tu te débrouilles bien."

#. [&"aldra", "Wake. We have guests."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:157 data/voice/lines/m02.json:L16
msgid "Wake. We have guests."
msgstr "Debout. Nous avons des invités."

#. [&"aldra", "Through my glass already? Go, then. The mere remembers every footstep."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:158 data/voice/lines/m02.json:L17
msgid "Through my glass already? Go, then. The mere remembers every footstep."
msgstr "Déjà à travers ma glace ? Va, alors. Le lac se souvient de chaque pas."

#. [&"torvald", "Run, little ember. Every relic you carry makes the Hollow hungrier. You will see."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:159 data/voice/lines/m02.json:L11
msgid "Run, little ember. Every relic you carry makes the Hollow hungrier. You will see."
msgstr "Cours, petite braise. Chaque relique que tu portes affame le Hollow. Tu verras."

#. [&"narrator", "Two relics answer to fire. In the north, Ice watches, and says nothing."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:160 data/voice/lines/m02.json:L12
msgid "Two relics answer to fire. In the north, Ice watches, and says nothing."
msgstr "Deux reliques répondent au feu. Au nord, la Glace observe, et se tait."

#. [&"vessa", "Too... cold... should have... brought a coat..."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:161 data/voice/lines/m02.json:L13
msgid "Too... cold... should have... brought a coat..."
msgstr "Trop... froid... aurais dû... prendre un manteau..."

#. [&"malrik", "Patience was never my virtue. Luckily, I brought shovels."],
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:162 data/voice/lines/m02.json:L14
msgid "Patience was never my virtue. Luckily, I brought shovels."
msgstr "La patience n'a jamais été ma vertu. Heureusement, j'ai des pelles."

#. "The Ember Crown sits on Vessa's head and will not stop humming. It hums loudest toward the north, where the r
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:165
msgid "The Ember Crown sits on Vessa's head and will not stop humming. It hums loudest toward the north, where the roads turn white and the rivers stop moving."
msgstr "L'Ember Crown repose sur la tête de Vessa et ne cesse de bourdonner. Elle bourdonne plus fort vers le nord, là où les routes blanchissent et où les rivières s'arrêtent."

#. "The Master's second relic, the Stillwater Orb, lies at the bottom of Glasswater Mere, sealed in Torvald's ice
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:166
msgid "The Master's second relic, the Stillwater Orb, lies at the bottom of Glasswater Mere, sealed in Torvald's ice for a hundred winters. Torvald has closed his lake to both armies. Malrik came anyway: his diggers are cutting down through the ice, one patient block at a time."
msgstr "La deuxième relique du Maître, le Stillwater Orb, gît au fond du Glasswater Mere, scellée dans la glace de Torvald depuis cent hivers. Torvald a fermé son lac aux deux armées. Malrik est venu quand même : ses fouilleurs creusent la glace, un bloc patient à la fois."

#. "Torvald will not fight for either side, but his lake fights everyone. Fire melts ice. Fire also cracks it.",
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:167
msgid "Torvald will not fight for either side, but his lake fights everyone. Fire melts ice. Fire also cracks it."
msgstr "Torvald ne se battra pour personne, mais son lac se bat contre tout le monde. Le feu fait fondre la glace. Le feu la fend aussi."

#. const BRIEFING_DIG_LINE := "Malrik's diggers are cutting toward the orb. Do not let them reach it."
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:169
msgid "Malrik's diggers are cutting toward the orb. Do not let them reach it."
msgstr "Les fouilleurs de Malrik creusent vers l'orbe. Ne les laissez pas l'atteindre."

#. const HINT_START := "Ash Hurlers (V at the Ember Hall) melt ice. Fireballs crack it."
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:170
msgid "Ash Hurlers (V at the Ember Hall) melt ice. Fireballs crack it."
msgstr "Les Ash Hurlers (V, Ember Hall) font fondre la glace. Les Fireballs la fendent."

#. const HINT_E11 := "Torvald's walls and Sentinels attack both armies. Break through and bring the orb home."
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:171
msgid "Torvald's walls and Sentinels attack both armies. Break through and bring the orb home."
msgstr "Les murailles et Sentinelles de Torvald attaquent les deux armées. Percez et rapportez l'orbe."

#. const MSG_STORM := "Torvald's storm is coming"
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:172
msgid "Torvald's storm is coming"
msgstr "La tempête de Torvald approche"

#. const MSG_ONLY_FIRE := "Only fire melts the Heartfrost (Vessa, Ash Hurlers)"
#: scripts/campaign/mission_02.gd:173
msgid "Only fire melts the Heartfrost (Vessa, Ash Hurlers)"
msgstr "Seul le feu fait fondre le Heartfrost (Vessa, Ash Hurlers)"

